# data/canonical/evidence/ (P2.2 durable canonical rows) IS committed.
PLAN.md
TAKEOVER.md
/evidence/
/archive/
OWNER-DECISIONS.md

# --- P2.6 exception: the canonical accepted-news archive IS committed ---
# (owner decision 2026-09-29, MAJOR 3 remediation: a durable archive that a
# fresh clone cannot see is not durable. Root-anchoring /archive/ above keeps
# the original root-level archive dir ignored; this negation re-includes the
# canonical tree's archive.)
!data/canonical/archive/

